{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>KNOCKOFF</strong> is a first of its kind Iso-fighter RPG that takes heavy influence from traditional 2D &amp; 3D Fighting Games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269810/extras/gif.gif?t=1747375048\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While the PVP demo is out now, and the full game is in development, which will feature ~15 hours of gameplay in <i><u>THE WORLD Shopping Center</u></i>, a endless, dead mall filled with ghosts,\u00a0 skeletons, and sprites. The world around you which once glittered with polish now glows only from ghost light. You play as the wanderer Amy, searching for an Exit. Make friends and unlock more characters along your journey: a lightning quick skateboarder, a lonely genius operating a monstrous machine, a possessed mannequin aching to feel alive... Try not to die, and never let the suffocating darkness wipe that smile off your face :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The fight is everything!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-PLUSHCATBOY</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3269810?t=1747375048","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269810/09e62a803c56093f7fa92ec6f62c498ad00a3749/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747375048","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269810/b527a87e6c4c17c86239a182daa3546073cac37f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747375048","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269810/b527a87e6c4c17c86239a182daa3546073cac37f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747375048","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3416990,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>KNOCKOFF</strong> is a first of its kind Iso-fighter RPG that takes heavy influence from traditional 2D &amp; 3D Fighting Games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269810/extras/gif.gif?t=1747375048\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While the PVP demo is out now, and the full game is in development, which will feature ~15 hours of gameplay in <i><u>THE WORLD Shopping Center</u></i>, a endless, dead mall filled with ghosts,\u00a0 skeletons, and sprites. The world around you which once glittered with polish now glows only from ghost light. You play as the wanderer Amy, searching for an Exit. Make friends and unlock more characters along your journey: a lightning quick skateboarder, a lonely genius operating a monstrous machine, a possessed mannequin aching to feel alive... Try not to die, and never let the suffocating darkness wipe that smile off your face :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The fight is everything!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-PLUSHCATBOY</p>","developers":["PLUSHCATBOY"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269810/header.jpg?t=1747375048","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OSX Mojave<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.9GHz quad-core Intel Core i7 or Apple M1 Silicon<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics